    "updated_at": "2026-05-29T10:34:33Z",
    "body": "And one more: after waiting for a new `<source>`, Firefox (the only one that will load it) transitions the `networkState` from `NO_SOURCE` to `LOADING` synchronously, without first waiting for a stable state (but then it waits for a stable state before reading the `.src` from that new `<source>`).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
